        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How is Gebinden pronounced? Nobody really knows, but it's fun to play anyway! Gebinden is a minimalist and simple to learn puzzle game that becomes exponentially more complex as you get farther in the campaign. Move 2 characters around a grid to maneuver them to their respective goals, while the character's movement is limited by the tiles around them AND the other color. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ Handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 uniquely themed chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 types of simple tiles that interact in complex ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Level Editor that can be used to create millions of levels for yourself and your friends to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist design that keeps you calm as you solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus tiles available in settings that aren't in the campaign, can be put into the editor for extra creative players!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How is Gebinden pronounced? Nobody really knows, but it's fun to play anyway! Gebinden is a minimalist and simple to learn puzzle game that becomes exponentially more complex as you get farther in the campaign. Move 2 characters around a grid to maneuver them to their respective goals, while the character's movement is limited by the tiles around them AND the other color. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ Handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 uniquely themed chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 types of simple tiles that interact in complex ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Level Editor that can be used to create millions of levels for yourself and your friends to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist design that keeps you calm as you solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus tiles available in settings that aren't in the campaign, can be put into the editor for extra creative players!</p></li></ul>",
